```

Notes on the structure:
- `## Connections` and `## Questions` are for me to fill in. Leave them empty: just the heading, nothing below it.
- `## Sources` contains only the one line for the paper analyzed. Any other works you refer to (philosophers, debates, related papers) are cited inline where they come up (author, title, year).

5. **Reply in chat** with only: the path of the note and a two-sentence summary of the paper.
PROMPT
